WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.380
I just caught my biggest

00:00:01.381 --> 00:00:04.561
trade of the month I've never seen this happen ever

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.380
so I was in this trade I was on the stream

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:08.601
this morning I said alright guys I'm gonna buy it here

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.020
at one dollar and twenty cents at a simple

00:00:11.021 --> 00:00:14.441
pullback off of VWAP and I said well I'm just gonna look for the break of the high of the day

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.840
well it squeezes it in less than five seconds

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.260
to three dollars and ninety seven cents that's not a glitch

00:00:21.261 --> 00:00:23.641
that actually happened 1:20

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.840
to 3 97 in literally like two seconds

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:30.760
look at the 10 second chart this actually happened 1:20

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.740
to 3:97 I got nothing sold

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:36.021
because I thought it was a glitch and I said well there's no way this is actually happening

00:00:36.022 --> 00:00:37.221
so I ended up trading myself

00:00:37.222 --> 00:00:40.301
from 1:20 all the way to two dollars and fifty cents

00:00:40.302 --> 00:00:43.181
this is one of those times where I was completely lost for words no

00:00:43.182 --> 00:00:45.401
idea what it just happened I thought it was fake

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:50.560
people were up five grand in seconds 21R day in seconds absolutely

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.640
unbelievable

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.260
this is why whenever the opportunity is there you take your shot

00:00:55.261 --> 00:00:58.191
and over time you'll catch a big home run
